# Tests on request

Add, expand, or generate tests **only when the user asked** (test, pytest, coverage, "write a test", "cover this").

A request to implement a feature, fix a bug, or refactor is not a request for tests. Ship the change without new test files.

```text
# asked: "add GET /items"
# BAD — also creates backend/tests/api/test_items.py
# GOOD — only the endpoint; tests wait for an explicit ask
```

If tests already fail because of your change, say so. Do not silently add a suite to make CI green unless the user asked.
